over the weekend about Donald Trump going

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:08.040
to the hospital for a multi hour unplanned
visit.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:13.390
It wasn't on his schedule with speculation,
just running rampant about what this is related

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:17.520
to and some of the people who emailed me about
this were speculating that maybe this is related

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.360
to Trump's cognitive decline, but you don't
get rushed to a hospital unexpectedly for

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:23.869
cognitive decline.

00:00:23.869 --> 00:00:27.110
You schedule a meeting with an urologist and
you get tested.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.660
So I don't believe that that's what this is
about.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:34.199
Now, the white house in retrospect is saying
that these were tests related to Trump's 2020

00:00:34.199 --> 00:00:38.719
annual physical, but it really doesn't make
sense because again, it wasn't on Trump's

00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:41.289
schedule and the hospital didn't know Trump
was coming.

00:00:41.289 --> 00:00:42.979
