00:00:58.889 --> 00:01:04.180
free weekend in Washington to just get ahead
on some portions of his routine checkup not

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:07.140
scheduled until next year doesn't really make
much sense.

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:08.440
And I'll tell you why in a second.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:12.860
Donald Trump also tweeting quote, visited
